  "label": "Self-Deprecating Humor",
  "description": "Self-deprecating humor is a form of humor where a person makes fun of themselves, often to appear more likable or to diffuse tension. The meme uses this style of humor by joking about a personal sexual experience, which is a cultural and social phenomenon that is not visible in the image but is necessary to understand the intent and tone of the meme.",
